  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Though the ether may technically be limitless, you still benefit from a \"waste not, want not\" approach.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Shed Alteration or Shed Gifts</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you dismiss an etherspell, your ether point regeneration rate increases by +2 for rounds equal to the highest manifestation level used in the etherspell.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ethermagic-feats#toc19\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
